<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Home Lab – Dokumentation</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #0d1117;
            color: #e6edf3;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 50px 25px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            margin-top: 45px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .intro {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .card {
            display: block;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #e6edf3;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: #58a6ff;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .card-description {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .diagram {
            margin-top: 25px;
            background: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 650px;
            border: 0;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>Home Lab</h1>

    <div class="intro">
        Technische Dokumentation einer virtualisierten IT-Infrastruktur.
    </div>

    <h2>📚 Dokumentation</h2>

    <div class="grid">

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/01-hardware-setup.html">
            <div class="card-title">🖥️ Hardware & Setup</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Hardware, Grundinstallation und Systemaufbau.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/02-netzwerk.html">
            <div class="card-title">🌐 Netzwerk</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Netzwerkstruktur, Adressierung und Konfiguration.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/03-vm-client.html">
            <div class="card-title">💻 VM – Client</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Dokumentation des virtuellen Client-Systems.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/04-vm-dc.html">
            <div class="card-title">🏢 VM – Domain Controller</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Dokumentation des Domain Controllers.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/05-vm-fw.html">
            <div class="card-title">🛡️ VM – Firewall</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Firewall und Netzwerkkonfiguration.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/06-vm-liste.html">
            <div class="card-title">📋 VM – Liste</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Übersicht der virtuellen Maschinen.
            </div>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href="Dokumentation/07-backup.html">
            <div class="card-title">💾 Backup</div>
            <div class="card-description">
                Backup-Konzept und Konfiguration.
            </div>
        </a>

    </div>


    <h2>📐 Infrastruktur-Diagramm</h2>

    <div class="diagram">

        <iframe
            src="https://viewer.diagrams.net/?nav=1&resize=1&toolbar=zoom%20layers&dark=auto#Uhttps%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FStefan-B%2Fhome.lab%2Fmain%2FDokumentation%2Fdiagramm.drawio"
            allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>

    </div>


    <div class="footer">
        Home Lab · Technische Projektdokumentation
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
